+        "defenses": "The nonce is emitted only when the notice bar is rendered on a Duplicator page, and the sink is scoped to `get_current_user_id()`.",
+        "refutation": "I did not find any shared option write, privilege change, or data exposure. Even if a lower-privileged user could obtain the nonce, the only effect would be hiding their own upsell notice bar.",
