codex
Wrote the Phase 2 report to [duplicator-phase2.codex.json](/Volumes/External_Disk/timo/WORDPRESS-PLUGIN-RESEARCH/reports/phase2/duplicator-phase2.codex.json). The result is `0` TP, `0` REVIEW, `10` rejected candidates.

The main refutations were: the Phase 1 AJAX anomalies in `ctrl.tools.php`, `ctrl.package.php`, and `class.web.services.php` do have effective nonce/capability gates in live code; the capability-less support-toolkit download only exposes its nonce on a `manage_options` Tools page; and the unauthenticated one-click-upgrade route is still gated by an export-only one-time-token handshake. JSON syntax was validated with `jq`.
